WEBVTT

00:08.000 --> 00:09.344
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.413 --> 00:10.965
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:11.034 --> 00:12.482
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.551 --> 00:14.586
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.655 --> 00:17.586
- ♪ Oh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.655 --> 00:19.620
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.689 --> 00:21.689
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.758 --> 00:23.517
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.586 --> 00:25.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.517 --> 00:27.655
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.724 --> 00:29.724
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.793 --> 00:31.620
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.689 --> 00:33.620
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.689 --> 00:35.413
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.482 --> 00:37.724
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.793 --> 00:39.655
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.724 --> 00:40.965
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.034 --> 00:42.827
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.896 --> 00:45.551
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.620 --> 00:48.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:53.551 --> 00:54.448
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

00:57.517 --> 01:01.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.103 --> 01:02.344
["Charge" fanfare]
【“冲锋”大张旗鼓】

01:02.413 --> 01:04.758
- What a beautiful day
for a ball game,
- 多么美好的一天
对于球类比赛来说，

01:04.827 --> 01:06.965
eh, sports fans?
呃，体育迷？

01:07.034 --> 01:08.931
Play ball!
[feedback whines]
打球吧！
[反馈抱怨声]

01:09.000 --> 01:11.034
Here's the pitch!
这里是球场！

01:11.103 --> 01:14.206
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

01:15.965 --> 01:17.827
- They're going,
they're going...
- 他们要去，
他们要去...

01:17.896 --> 01:21.758
both: We're gone!
两人：我们走了！

01:21.827 --> 01:24.103
- You're out of there!
- 你出去了！

01:24.172 --> 01:25.620
- Ay-fwi-oof.
- 哎呀哎哟。

01:25.689 --> 01:27.517
[festive music]
[节日音乐]

01:27.586 --> 01:30.482
- Boy, do I love the two-fisted
fun at Glove World!
- 男孩，我喜欢双拳吗
手套世界的乐趣！

01:30.551 --> 01:32.482
[laughs]
[笑]

01:32.551 --> 01:35.379
- And the ham fists
aren't bad either!
- 还有火腿拳头
也不错！

01:35.448 --> 01:37.931
- Wow, that ride was so fun.
- 哇，那趟旅程真有趣。

01:38.000 --> 01:39.206
I could do it
a million, zillion, jillion,
我能做到
一百万、无数、十亿、

01:39.275 --> 01:41.344
dillion, cotillion times!
迪里恩，舞会时间！

01:41.413 --> 01:43.034
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

01:43.103 --> 01:45.103
- I got you covered!
- 我已经帮你搞定了！

01:45.172 --> 01:47.931
[strained grunting]
[紧张的咕哝声]

01:48.000 --> 01:50.551
both: Oh, yeah!
两人：哦，是啊！

01:56.689 --> 01:59.448
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

01:59.517 --> 02:02.137
- You're out of there!
Whatever.
- 你出去了！
任何。

02:07.344 --> 02:11.413
- [screams]
- Oh, my baby's eyes!
- [尖叫]
- 哦，我宝贝的眼睛！

02:11.482 --> 02:13.862
- Patrick?
- Yeah?
- 帕特里克？
- 是的？

02:13.931 --> 02:15.551
- I think we overdid it.
- 我认为我们做得太过分了。

02:15.620 --> 02:17.241
[spines cracking]
[脊椎开裂]

02:17.310 --> 02:19.724
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

02:19.793 --> 02:21.689
- It's debatable.
- 这是有争议的。

02:23.310 --> 02:25.517
- Oh, I have an idea.
- 哦，我有一个主意。

02:25.586 --> 02:29.517
Let us take a break
in the theater!
让我们休息一下
在剧院里！

02:31.931 --> 02:33.241
- Oof!
- 噢！

02:33.310 --> 02:36.275
Ah. Mm, mm, mm, mm.
啊。毫米，毫米，毫米，毫米。

02:36.344 --> 02:38.551
- Oh!
- 哦！

02:38.620 --> 02:40.068
- Snack bar break!
- 小吃店休息！

02:40.137 --> 02:42.724
[both whimpering excitedly]
[两人兴奋地呜咽]

02:42.793 --> 02:45.827
[both chomping]
[都在咀嚼]

02:45.896 --> 02:47.448
both: Eh?
两人：呃？

02:49.793 --> 02:52.275
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

02:52.344 --> 02:54.793
[hydraulics whirring]
[液压系统的呼呼声]

02:54.862 --> 02:56.310
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

02:56.379 --> 03:00.034
It's him!
It's really him!
是他！
真的是他！

03:00.103 --> 03:03.034
- Right, it's me!
Hieronymus Glove!
- 对了，是我！
希罗尼姆斯手套！

03:03.103 --> 03:08.379
I'm the bloomin' creator
and spokesmate of Glove World!
我是绽放的创造者
也是手套世界的代言人！

03:08.448 --> 03:10.827
- Glove World is a subsidiary
of FingerFun Industries.
- 手套世界是子公司
FingerFun 工业公司。

03:10.896 --> 03:12.000
All rights reserved.
版权所有。

03:12.068 --> 03:13.793
[both giggling excitedly]
[两人兴奋地咯咯笑]

03:13.862 --> 03:15.758
- Yeah, come on!
Yeah!
- 是的，来吧！
是的！

03:15.827 --> 03:19.103
- Welcome
to the wonderfully whimsical
- 欢迎
到奇妙的异想天开

03:19.172 --> 03:24.275
and wickedly woven world
of the glove!
和邪恶编织的世界
手套的！

03:24.344 --> 03:27.758
- ♪ Gloves, gloves, gloves!
Gloves, gloves, gloves! ♪
- ♪ 手套，手套，手套！
手套，手套，手套！ ♪

03:27.827 --> 03:29.862
♪ Gloves, gloves, gloves,
gloves, gloves! ♪
♪ 手套，手套，手套，
手套，手套！ ♪

03:29.931 --> 03:31.517
- ♪ If you want
to wear something ♪
- ♪ 如果你愿意的话
穿一些东西♪

03:31.586 --> 03:33.344
♪ On your hand or fist ♪
♪ 在你的手上或拳头上 ♪

03:33.413 --> 03:35.758
♪ There's really nothing
quite like gloves! ♪
♪ 真的什么都没有
很像手套！ ♪

03:35.827 --> 03:39.137
♪ And if you don't want
to leave fingerprints ♪
♪ 如果你不想
留下指纹♪

03:39.206 --> 03:41.827
♪ I've got a pair
that you're just gonna love! ♪
♪ 我有一双
你一定会喜欢的！ ♪

03:41.896 --> 03:45.103
♪ If you want complete
knuckle protection ♪
♪ 如果你想要完整
保护指关节♪

03:45.172 --> 03:48.379
♪ When you stick your hand
inside a block of cheese ♪
♪ 当你伸出你的手时
里面有一块奶酪♪

03:48.448 --> 03:49.724
♪ A glove is the thing
you want ♪
♪ 手套就是关键
你想要♪

03:49.793 --> 03:51.310
♪ A glove
is the thing you need ♪
♪ 手套
是你需要的东西♪

03:51.379 --> 03:54.586
♪ So wear a glove,
if you please! ♪
♪ 所以戴上手套，
如果你愿意的话！ ♪

03:54.655 --> 03:56.000
singers: ♪ Get yourself
some fourchettes ♪
歌手：♪ 做你自己
一些四边形 ♪

03:56.068 --> 03:57.482
♪ Gussets, tranks, and quirks ♪
♪ 角板、背心和怪癖 ♪

03:57.551 --> 03:58.965
♪ Slap a pair of thumbs
on that ♪
♪ 拍打大拇指
关于那个♪

03:59.034 --> 04:01.206
♪ And you've got a look
that works ♪
♪ 你看看
有效 ♪

04:01.275 --> 04:04.965
- ♪ Queen Elizafish the First
wore her gloves every day ♪
- ♪ 伊丽莎白一世女王
每天都戴着手套♪

04:05.034 --> 04:08.034
♪ To preserve and protect
her lovely mitts ♪
♪ 保存和保护
她可爱的手套♪

04:08.103 --> 04:11.000
♪ Hats protect your head,
and shoes protect your feet ♪
♪ 帽子保护你的头，
鞋子可以保护你的脚♪

04:11.068 --> 04:12.551
♪ But gloves protect you
from getting sick ♪
♪ 但手套可以保护你
免得生病♪

04:12.620 --> 04:14.379
♪ From everyone you meet ♪
♪ 来自你遇到的每个人 ♪

04:14.448 --> 04:15.620
♪ So if you box
or build or drive ♪
♪ 所以如果你装箱
或建造或驾驶 ♪

04:15.689 --> 04:17.103
♪ Or cook or clean the loo ♪
♪ 或者做饭或打扫厕所 ♪

04:17.172 --> 04:19.896
♪ We've got a special glove
made just for you ♪
♪ 我们有一只特殊的手套
专为你打造♪

04:19.965 --> 04:23.172
♪ A glove is beyond compare,
as essential as underwear ♪
♪ 手套是无与伦比的，
和内衣一样重要♪

04:23.241 --> 04:25.344
♪ If I were you, I'd buy two ♪
♪ 如果我是你，我会买两个 ♪

04:25.413 --> 04:27.068
singers: ♪ Gloves! ♪
歌手：♪ 手套！ ♪

04:27.137 --> 04:29.448
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

04:29.517 --> 04:31.310
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

04:31.379 --> 04:34.931
both: Yeah, yeah, yeah!
[moaning]
两人：是啊是啊！
[呻吟]

04:37.206 --> 04:39.379
- Ah, that song reminds me
- 啊，那首歌让我想起了

04:39.448 --> 04:42.034
of putting on a glove
for the very first time.
戴上手套
第一次。

04:42.103 --> 04:46.517
It was warm and cozy
and sweaty.
温暖又舒适
和出汗。

04:46.586 --> 04:48.586
- Oh!
I wanna meet the Glove guy!
- 哦！
我想见见戴手套的人！

04:48.655 --> 04:52.275
- Ooh!
Maybe he'll sign my gloves.
- 哦！
也许他会在我的手套上签名。

04:52.344 --> 04:55.517
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

04:58.379 --> 05:00.862
- [grunts]
Aww!
- [咕哝]
哇！

05:00.931 --> 05:03.482
- [laughs]
[panting]
- [笑]
[气喘吁吁]

05:03.551 --> 05:06.689
Oh, Mr. Glove, Mr. Glove.
Oh, hi, I'm your biggest fan.
哦，手套先生，手套先生。
哦，嗨，我是你最大的粉丝。

05:06.758 --> 05:08.862
I've been on all your rides.
Ask anyone!
我坐过你所有的游乐设施。
问任何人！

05:08.931 --> 05:12.310
I'm here every weekend
and throwing up!
我每个周末都在这里
并呕吐！

05:12.379 --> 05:13.620
[electricity crackles]
Ah! Huh?
[电流爆裂声]
啊！啊？

05:13.689 --> 05:16.724
- I need repair!
I need repair!
- 我需要修理！
我需要修理！

05:16.793 --> 05:20.034
- Oh, I'm sorry!
It was an accident.
- 哦，对不起！
这是一次意外。

05:20.103 --> 05:21.344
- I need repair!
- Shh!
- 我需要修理！
- 嘘！

05:21.413 --> 05:22.551
- I need repair!
- 我需要修理！

05:22.620 --> 05:24.206
- Be quiet
or I'll get in trouble!
- 保持安静
不然我会遇到麻烦的！

05:24.275 --> 05:26.275
- I need repair!
I need repair!
- 我需要修理！
我需要修理！

05:26.344 --> 05:28.827
I need repair!
- Doof, shh!
我需要修理！
- 杜夫，嘘！

05:28.896 --> 05:31.103
Stupid!
Shh, shh!
愚蠢的！
嘘，嘘！

05:31.172 --> 05:33.000
- I need repair!
- Shut up, shut up, shut up!
- 我需要修理！
- 闭嘴，闭嘴，闭嘴！

05:33.068 --> 05:34.689
[grunts]
Huh?
[咕哝]
啊？

05:34.758 --> 05:38.103
- Patrick, what are you doing
to our childhood hero?
- 帕特里克，你在做什么
我们儿时的英雄？

05:38.172 --> 05:39.689
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:39.758 --> 05:42.862
- He wouldn't be quiet.
Ah, ooh, ooh!
- 他不会安静的。
啊啊啊啊啊！

05:42.931 --> 05:45.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:47.551 --> 05:50.862
[audience screaming]
[观众尖叫]

05:50.931 --> 05:51.862
- Ah!
- 啊！

05:54.103 --> 05:56.448
D'oh!
噢！

05:56.517 --> 05:58.034
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

05:58.103 --> 06:00.689
- Freeze, vandals!
- 冻结，破坏者！

06:00.758 --> 06:01.689
- Ah!
- 啊！

06:01.758 --> 06:03.172
Get away!
逃离！

06:03.241 --> 06:05.068
Get away now!
- Okay, Patrick.
现在就走吧！
- 好吧，帕特里克。

06:05.137 --> 06:08.000
Just calm down a second,
Take a deep breath,
冷静一下，
深吸一口气，

06:08.068 --> 06:09.793
and hand me the head.
然后把头递给我。

06:09.862 --> 06:12.137
- Better do what
your friend says, son.
- 最好做什么
你的朋友说，儿子。

06:12.206 --> 06:14.827
- [whimpering]
- Mm-hmm.
- [呜咽]
- 嗯嗯。

06:14.896 --> 06:16.241
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

06:16.310 --> 06:18.344
- Oh, officers, he didn't mean
to kill Hieronymus Glove!
- 哦，警官们，他不是这个意思
杀死希罗尼姆斯手套！

06:18.413 --> 06:20.137
He just doesn't know
his own strength!
他只是不知道
他自己的实力！

06:20.206 --> 06:23.862
Or his own reflection.
I don't know how he shaves.
或者他自己的反映。
不知道他是怎么刮胡子的

06:23.931 --> 06:25.724
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:25.793 --> 06:28.724
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

06:31.344 --> 06:33.517
- He didn't kill anyone, kid.
- 他没有杀任何人，孩子。

06:33.586 --> 06:35.896
This is not a real head,
这不是真正的头，

06:35.965 --> 06:38.793
it's an animatra-nautical
dummy-head.
这是一个航海动画
假头。

06:38.862 --> 06:41.551
- Hey, who you calling
a "dummy-head"?
- 嘿，你给谁打电话
“假头”？

06:41.620 --> 06:43.000
Wait, what did you say?
等等，你说什么？

06:43.068 --> 06:44.448
- The real Hieronymus Glove
- 真正的希罗尼姆斯手套

06:44.517 --> 06:46.793
has been frozen in ice
for decades now.
已经被冰冻住了
几十年来。

06:48.586 --> 06:50.827
- Oh, Patrick,
it was only a robot head.
- 哦，帕特里克，
它只是一个机器人头。

06:50.896 --> 06:53.000
- Hoo, for a minute there,
I thought we were in trouble.
- 呼，等一下，
我以为我们有麻烦了。

06:53.068 --> 06:54.413
[yells]
[喊叫]

06:54.482 --> 06:57.275
- You are in trouble!
[both gulp]
- 你有麻烦了！
[两人都咽了一口]

06:57.344 --> 07:00.620
And you're going
to Glove World Jail!
你要去
去手套世界监狱！

07:00.689 --> 07:04.413
both: [gasping]
Glove World Jail?
两人：[喘气]
手套世界监狱？

07:04.482 --> 07:06.103
- I thought
that was an urban myth.
- 我以为
那是一个都市神话。

07:06.172 --> 07:07.689
- You mean an urban truth?
- 你是说都市真相吗？

07:07.758 --> 07:09.551
both: Glove me!
- Okay.
两人：给我戴上手套！
- 好的。

07:09.620 --> 07:11.724
[both squealing]
[两人尖叫]

07:11.793 --> 07:13.137
[officers grumbling]
- Wow.
[军官抱怨]
- 哇。

07:13.206 --> 07:16.310
both: Ooh.
[laughing]
两人：哦。
[笑]

07:16.379 --> 07:19.758
Jail time jackpot!
[grunting]
坐牢累积奖金！
[咕噜声]

07:19.827 --> 07:23.000
- Please don't do that.
both: [giggling]
- 请不要这样做。
两人：[咯咯笑]

07:27.448 --> 07:30.241
[both straining]
[双方都紧张]

07:30.310 --> 07:32.586
- Sorry.
- Yeah, he's sorry.
- 对不起。
- 是的，他很抱歉。

07:32.655 --> 07:35.034
[muffled mumbling]
[低声咕哝]

07:35.103 --> 07:36.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:36.689 --> 07:38.793
[both yell, grunt]
[两人大喊，咕哝]

07:38.862 --> 07:42.241
- All right, close number five.
[gate buzzes]
- 好吧，结束第五名。
[门声响起]

07:42.310 --> 07:45.551
[gloves laughing]
- Hmm?
[手套笑]
- 嗯？

07:45.620 --> 07:48.482
[gloves singing melody]
[手套唱旋律]

07:48.551 --> 07:52.241
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:52.310 --> 07:54.862
- Whoo!
- [laughs]
- 呼！
- [笑]

07:54.931 --> 07:57.448
- Patrick, this is exactly
how I always thought
- 帕特里克，这正是
我一直以为

07:57.517 --> 07:58.724
Glove Jail would look.
手套监狱会看看。

07:58.793 --> 07:59.689
- Look!
- 看！

07:59.758 --> 08:01.413
both: Hmm?
Hmm?
两人：嗯？
唔？

08:01.482 --> 08:03.034
[all whistling]
[全都吹口哨]

08:03.103 --> 08:06.275
[hydraulics whirring]
[液压系统的呼呼声]

08:06.344 --> 08:09.448
[swashbuckling music]
[虚张声势的音乐]

08:09.517 --> 08:11.827
both: Hmm?
两人：嗯？

08:11.896 --> 08:15.655
- Breaking the rules, eh?
[cackles]
- 违反规则，嗯？
[咯咯笑]

08:15.724 --> 08:18.379
Good for you, matey!
对你有好处，伙计！

08:18.448 --> 08:21.862
- I didn't break the rules.
I broke a dummy head.
- 我没有违反规则。
我打破了一个假头。

08:21.931 --> 08:26.275
- Breaking the rules, eh?
[cackles]
- 违反规则，嗯？
[咯咯笑]

08:26.344 --> 08:27.965
Good for you, matey!
对你有好处，伙计！

08:28.034 --> 08:30.827
- I just told you!
Stop saying that!
- 我刚刚告诉过你了！
别再说了！

08:30.896 --> 08:31.965
Oof!
钱币！

08:32.034 --> 08:34.551
- Breaking the rules, eh?
[cackles]
- 违反规则，嗯？
[咯咯笑]

08:34.620 --> 08:36.551
- Shut up, shut up, shut up!
- 闭嘴，闭嘴，闭嘴！

08:36.620 --> 08:39.172
- Oh, not again, Patrick.
He's just a robot.
-哦，别再这样了，帕特里克。
他只是一个机器人。

08:39.241 --> 08:42.896
They're all robots.
We're the only ones here.
他们都是机器人。
我们是这里唯一的人。

08:42.965 --> 08:45.275
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:45.344 --> 08:48.551
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

08:48.620 --> 08:51.241
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:51.310 --> 08:52.827
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:52.896 --> 08:54.724
- Aw.
Hello there!
- 噢。
你好呀！

08:54.793 --> 08:56.724
What's a little guy like you
doing in jail?
像你这样的小家伙算什么
在监狱里做什么？

08:56.793 --> 08:58.551
- Pooping without a license?
- 无证便便？

08:58.620 --> 09:01.172
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

09:01.241 --> 09:02.689
- You heard that, right?
- 你听到了，对吧？

09:02.758 --> 09:05.551
- Pooping...license...
[laughing]
- 拉屎...许可证...
[笑]

09:05.620 --> 09:07.551
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

09:07.620 --> 09:09.793
- Uh, hello.
- Oh, hello.
- 呃，你好。
- 哦，你好。

09:09.862 --> 09:12.586
- Hey, man, what you in for?
- 嘿，伙计，你来干什么？

09:12.655 --> 09:14.586
- Defacing
Glove World property.
- 污损
手套世界财产。

09:14.655 --> 09:16.413
- "Allegedly."
——《据说》。

09:16.482 --> 09:18.413
- What are you all in for?
- 你们都在干嘛？

09:18.482 --> 09:19.793
- I didn't keep
my arms and legs
-我没有保留
我的胳膊和腿

09:19.862 --> 09:22.000
inside the ride at all times.
始终在车内。

09:22.068 --> 09:23.655
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:23.724 --> 09:27.862
- I stood up at the top
of the roller coaster.
- 我站在最顶端
过山车的。

09:27.931 --> 09:30.344
- [grunts]
Murder one!
- [咕哝]
杀人一！

09:30.413 --> 09:32.310
[chomps, growls]
[咀嚼，咆哮]

09:32.379 --> 09:34.310
[kids whimper]
[孩子们呜咽]

09:34.379 --> 09:37.241
I'm kidding, I'm just here
'cause I bit the lemonade guy.
我开玩笑的，我只是在这里
因为我咬了那个喝柠檬水的家伙。

09:37.310 --> 09:39.034
- That guy hates kids.
- 那家伙讨厌孩子。

09:39.103 --> 09:41.896
- That's why I bit him.
High five.
- 这就是我咬他的原因。
高五。

09:41.965 --> 09:46.068
- Let's celebrate!
Cotton candy rats for everyone!
- 让我们庆祝一下！
送给大家的棉花糖老鼠！

09:46.137 --> 09:47.862
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

09:47.931 --> 09:49.931
- [chomping, gulping]
- [咀嚼，吞咽]

09:50.000 --> 09:54.655
Duh, hee, hee, hee!
[shouting]
呵呵，嘿嘿嘿！
[喊叫]

09:54.724 --> 09:59.862
- Uh-oh, I think I smell a...
- Cannonball!
- 呃-哦，我想我闻到了......
- 炮弹！

09:59.931 --> 10:02.068
[all cheering]
- [laughs]
[大家欢呼]
- [笑]

10:02.137 --> 10:03.482
Huh?
啊？

10:03.551 --> 10:04.896
- [squeaking]
- [吱吱声]

10:04.965 --> 10:07.241
- Hey, little guy, come back!
- 嘿，小家伙，回来吧！

10:07.310 --> 10:08.827
- [laughing]
- [笑]

10:08.896 --> 10:11.379
- You're too little
to be on your own.
- 你还太小了
靠你自己。

10:11.448 --> 10:13.310
- [laughing]
- [笑]

10:13.379 --> 10:15.586
- Hey, Patrick, we've gotta--
- 嘿，帕特里克，我们必须——

10:15.655 --> 10:18.137
[kids cheering]
[孩子们欢呼]

10:18.206 --> 10:20.103
Hmm.
唔。

10:20.172 --> 10:22.034
[strained grunting]
[紧张的咕哝声]

10:22.103 --> 10:23.896
[grunts]
Huh?
[咕哝]
啊？

10:23.965 --> 10:27.172
- Hey, you mugs,
it's a jail break!
- 嘿，你们这些笨蛋，
这是越狱！

10:27.241 --> 10:29.586
Let's amscray!
让我们来吧！

10:29.655 --> 10:33.517
[kids cheering]
[孩子们欢呼]

10:33.586 --> 10:35.068
- Ugh...
- 呃...

10:35.137 --> 10:36.586
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

10:36.655 --> 10:38.551
[yelling]
[大喊]

10:38.620 --> 10:40.724
[eyes rattling]
[眼睛颤抖]

10:40.793 --> 10:43.310
I think I stood up too quick.
我想我站得太快了。

10:43.379 --> 10:44.827
- Come on, Patrick!
- 来吧，帕特里克！

10:44.896 --> 10:46.379
We have to go after
that escaped little boy!
我们必须去追寻
那个逃跑的小男孩！

10:46.448 --> 10:47.896
- Looks like we all escaped!
- 看来我们都逃了！

10:47.965 --> 10:49.551
- I'll pull the escape alarm.
- 我会拉动逃生警报。

10:49.620 --> 10:51.448
We don't want
to break the law twice.
我们不想要
两次触犯法律。

10:51.517 --> 10:52.551
[grunts]
Huh?
[咕哝]
啊？

10:52.620 --> 10:54.241
[alarm ringing, blaring]
[警报响起，刺耳的声音]

10:54.310 --> 10:55.655
- Hey!
Is that the kid?
- 嘿！
是那个孩子吗？

10:55.724 --> 10:57.137
- Ah!
That's him!
- 啊！
就是他！

10:57.206 --> 11:00.689
Little boy, come back!
I saved you a rat!
小男孩，快回来吧！
我救了你一只老鼠！

11:00.758 --> 11:03.758
- I need repair!
I need repair!
- 我需要修理！
我需要修理！

11:03.827 --> 11:07.000
I need repair!
I need repair!
我需要修理！
我需要修理！

11:07.068 --> 11:10.620
I need repair!
I need repair!
我需要修理！
我需要修理！

11:10.689 --> 11:12.689
I need repair!
- Hmm.
我需要修理！
- 唔。

11:12.758 --> 11:14.931
[humming]
- I need repair!
[嗡嗡声]
- 我需要修理！

11:15.000 --> 11:16.758
I need repair!
- Ooh!
我需要修理！
- 哦！

11:16.827 --> 11:19.413
I need repair!
I need repair!
我需要修理！
我需要修理！

11:19.482 --> 11:21.172
Reboot!
Reboot!
重启！
重启！

11:21.241 --> 11:24.379
Hmm, hmm?
[growls]
嗯嗯？
[咆哮]

11:24.448 --> 11:26.172
- All right, break time!
- 好吧，休息时间！

11:26.241 --> 11:29.206
- Hey, you grease monkeys!
No tea breaks!
- 嘿，你们这些油腻的猴子！
没有茶歇！

11:29.275 --> 11:31.965
Put my head back on my buddy
this bloomin' instant!
把我的头放回我的伙伴身上
这一刻绽放！

11:32.034 --> 11:34.241
- Yeah, we'll get
right on that.
- 是的，我们会得到
就在那一点上。

11:34.310 --> 11:35.655
Guvna.
古芙娜。

11:35.724 --> 11:39.137
[both laugh]
- [growls]
[两人都笑了]
- [咆哮]

11:39.206 --> 11:42.241
[yells]
[growls]
[喊叫]
[咆哮]

11:42.310 --> 11:46.172
If I ever see that pink
dimwitted dough boy again,
如果我看到那粉色
又是一个愚蠢的面团男孩，

11:46.241 --> 11:48.517
I'll take
his bloomin' head off!
我会采取
他那花花绿绿的头掉下来了！

11:48.586 --> 11:49.758
[grunts]
[咕哝]

11:53.034 --> 11:53.862
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

11:53.931 --> 11:56.862
- [grunts]
Gotcha!
- [咕哝]
明白了！

11:56.931 --> 11:58.655
Oi!
哎呀！

11:58.724 --> 12:01.413
Better hold his hand,
that way he won't wander off.
最好握住他的手
这样他就不会迷失方向。

12:01.482 --> 12:02.862
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

12:02.931 --> 12:06.827
- Hmm.
So many doors.
- 唔。
这么多门。

12:06.896 --> 12:08.931
Hmm.
[lips flapping]
唔。
[嘴唇颤动]

12:09.000 --> 12:10.551
Which way should we go?
我们应该走哪条路？

12:10.620 --> 12:16.172
scientists: Research, research,
research, idea, research...
科学家：研究，研究，
研究、想法、研究...

12:16.241 --> 12:19.413
- I wanna ride the slide walk!
- Whoa!
- 我想玩滑梯！
- 哇！

12:19.482 --> 12:22.379
[adventurous music]
[冒险音乐]

12:22.448 --> 12:25.965
- This is crazy!
both: Danger?
- 这太疯狂了！
两人：危险？

12:26.034 --> 12:30.448
Glove testing?
[laughing]
手套测试？
[笑]

12:30.517 --> 12:35.482
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:35.551 --> 12:37.103
[electricity whirring]
- [laughs]
[电呼呼]
- [笑]

12:37.172 --> 12:40.241
[yells]
[explosion whooshing]
[喊叫]
[嗖嗖爆炸]

12:40.310 --> 12:43.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:43.172 --> 12:46.620
[audience murmuring]
- A success.
[观众窃窃私语]
- 成功了。

12:46.689 --> 12:49.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:49.586 --> 12:53.413
all: Oh!
全体：哦！

12:53.482 --> 12:55.724
both: "Guard Glove Training"?
两者：“警卫手套训练”？

12:55.793 --> 12:57.413
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

12:57.482 --> 12:59.310
- Release the gloves!
- 松开手套！

12:59.379 --> 13:03.620
[dogs barking]
[狗吠]

13:03.689 --> 13:06.034
- Aw, they must smell Gary.
- 哦，他们一定闻到了加里的味道。

13:06.103 --> 13:08.379
[dogs barking]
- [cooing]
[狗吠]
- [咕咕声]

13:08.448 --> 13:11.103
[alarm bell ringing]
[警钟长鸣]

13:11.172 --> 13:16.034
[dogs barking]
- Tell Mom I love her!
[狗吠]
- 告诉妈妈我爱她！

13:17.724 --> 13:19.068
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

13:19.137 --> 13:23.586
both: Ooh!
Sock World Prototype?
两人：哦！
袜子世界原型？

13:23.655 --> 13:26.103
- Yes, Sock World.
- 是的，袜子世界。

13:26.172 --> 13:29.241
The eighth wonder
of the seven seas!
第八个奇迹
七大洋的！

13:29.310 --> 13:35.000
The experimental prototype
smelly city of the future!
实验原型
未来的臭城市！

13:35.068 --> 13:37.793
Please keep your nose pins on
at all times.
请戴上鼻夹
任何时候。

13:37.862 --> 13:40.413
Because seriously,
the stink is like, wow!
因为说真的，
臭味就像，哇！

13:40.482 --> 13:44.724
both: Stinky Sock coasters
are like, wow!
两者：臭袜子杯垫
就像，哇！

13:44.793 --> 13:46.827
- Don't you love it,
little guy?
- 你不喜欢它吗
小家伙？

13:46.896 --> 13:48.931
both: Little guy?
两人：小家伙？

13:49.000 --> 13:49.965
- Oh!
- 哦！

13:50.034 --> 13:52.103
Oh, maybe he's hiding
in my mouth!
哦，也许他躲起来了
在我嘴里！

13:52.172 --> 13:54.551
Is he in there?
- There he is!
他在里面吗？
- 他在那儿！

13:54.620 --> 13:56.310
- Ah!
Get him out of there!
- 啊！
带他离开那里！

13:56.379 --> 13:58.172
Ah, I'm not hungry, yet!
啊，我还没饿呢！

13:58.241 --> 14:00.586
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

14:00.655 --> 14:02.379
- Let's go!
- 我们走吧！

14:02.448 --> 14:05.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:05.379 --> 14:08.310
- Ooh.
Ooh.
- 哦。
哦。

14:08.379 --> 14:10.551
[hydraulics whirring]
[液压系统的呼呼声]

14:10.620 --> 14:13.827
[cooing curiously]
[好奇地咕咕叫]

14:13.896 --> 14:15.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

14:16.034 --> 14:18.000
Whoa!
Oh!
哇！
哦！

14:18.068 --> 14:20.827
Whoa!
Go, go, go!
哇！
去！去！去！

14:20.896 --> 14:23.655
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
哇、哇、哇、哇、哇！

14:23.724 --> 14:25.896
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

14:25.965 --> 14:27.758
- Stop, thief!
- 住手，小偷！

14:27.827 --> 14:29.482
That's Glove World's
bloomin' property!
这就是手套世界
绽放财产！

14:29.551 --> 14:30.758
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

14:30.827 --> 14:33.172
- Oh, uh, after you, sir.
- 哦，呃，在你之后，先生。

14:33.241 --> 14:35.551
Oh, I don't see the kid,
Patrick.
哦，我没看到那孩子，
帕特里克.

14:35.620 --> 14:37.206
- Pardon me, gents.
- 请原谅我，先生们。

14:37.275 --> 14:39.275
Did anyone see a little kid
come through--
有谁看到一个小孩
过来——

14:39.344 --> 14:40.551
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

14:40.620 --> 14:43.241
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

14:43.310 --> 14:46.620
- Whoa.
both: Robot morgue!
- 哇哦。
两者：机器人太平间！

14:46.689 --> 14:49.655
Cool!
凉爽的！

14:49.724 --> 14:52.827
[both beeping, booping]
[同时发出嘟嘟声、嘘声]

14:55.310 --> 14:58.172
[screaming]
[尖叫]

14:58.241 --> 14:59.827
Whoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!
呼呼呼呼！

14:59.896 --> 15:02.448
[gargling]
Huh?
[漱口]
啊？

15:02.517 --> 15:05.827
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

15:05.896 --> 15:09.000
- Hey, did that kid
eat a robot?
- 嘿，那孩子是吗？
吃机器人？

15:09.068 --> 15:11.241
Or did that robot eat a kid?
或者那个机器人吃了一个孩子？

15:11.310 --> 15:13.517
- Either way, it's probably
against the rules.
- 不管怎样，这可能是
违反规则。

15:13.586 --> 15:15.448
Let's get him!
我们来抓住他吧！

15:15.517 --> 15:17.103
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

15:17.172 --> 15:19.620
- It's the blinkin' bloke
what broke off me melon!
- 这是那个眨眼的家伙
是什么打破了我的瓜！

15:19.689 --> 15:23.344
Whoa!
[growls]
哇！
[咆哮]

15:23.413 --> 15:26.758
Nobody breaks off my bloomin'
head and gets away with it!
没有人能阻止我的绽放
头并逃脱它！

15:26.827 --> 15:31.000
I'm Hieronymus Glove!
我是希罗尼姆斯手套！

15:31.068 --> 15:32.793
- This robot head
does not reflect the views
- 这个机器人头
不反映观点

15:32.862 --> 15:34.862
of Fingerfun Industries.
Fingerfun 工业公司。

15:34.931 --> 15:36.448
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

15:36.517 --> 15:38.379
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

15:38.448 --> 15:41.172
- Come here, little guy!
That's a good boy.
- 过来，小家伙！
那是个好孩子。

15:41.241 --> 15:43.206
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

15:45.448 --> 15:46.793
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

15:46.862 --> 15:49.241
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

15:49.310 --> 15:52.551
- Wait up, little guy!
[both scream]
- 等等，小家伙！
[两人尖叫]

15:52.620 --> 15:55.689
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

15:55.758 --> 15:56.896
both: Oh!
两人：哦！

15:58.413 --> 15:59.551
- Gotcha!
- 明白了！

15:59.620 --> 16:02.689
- Let's see
if these bloomin' bozos
- 让我们看看
如果这些花花公子

16:02.758 --> 16:05.310
like this blinking blimey ride!
就像这个眨眼的天哪！

16:05.379 --> 16:08.310
[growls, grunts]
[咆哮，咕哝]

16:08.379 --> 16:11.448
both: Whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa!
两人：哇哦，哇哦，
哇，哇，哇！

16:11.517 --> 16:14.482
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

16:14.551 --> 16:19.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:19.896 --> 16:23.724
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

16:23.793 --> 16:26.379
all: Whoo!
全体：呼！

16:26.448 --> 16:28.862
[all scream]
- [cackles]
[所有人尖叫]
- [咯咯笑]

16:28.931 --> 16:31.689
both: Ah!
Whoo-hoo!
两人：啊！
呼呼！

16:31.758 --> 16:33.137
- Whoa!
- [cackles]
- 哇！
- [咯咯笑]

16:33.206 --> 16:35.103
both: [grunting]
- [coos]
两人：[咕哝]
- [咕咕]

16:35.172 --> 16:38.827
- Mmm, warm socks
just out of the dryer.
- 嗯，温暖的袜子
刚从烘干机里出来。

16:38.896 --> 16:41.655
[all sigh]
[众人叹息]

16:41.724 --> 16:42.965
both: [gasping]
两人：[喘气]

16:43.034 --> 16:47.310
[gasping, sighing]
[喘气，叹气]

16:47.379 --> 16:50.275
There really is a sock world!
真的有一个袜子世界！

16:50.344 --> 16:55.275
Eeh!
It really does stink!
呃！
确实很臭！

16:55.344 --> 16:57.482
Ooh-hoo-hoo!
哦呼呼！

16:57.551 --> 17:00.689
- [laughs]
Ew.
- [笑]
呃。

17:00.758 --> 17:01.793
Ooh?
哦？

17:01.862 --> 17:03.034
- Ew.
- 呃。

17:03.103 --> 17:04.448
This place is the greatest,
这个地方最大，

17:04.517 --> 17:07.206
but I wish I could turn
the smell down a skosh.
但我希望我能转身
气味下降了。

17:07.275 --> 17:11.000
- Hey, I found
the stink switch!
- 嘿，我发现了
臭开关！

17:11.068 --> 17:12.103
[sharp exhale]
[急促的呼气]

17:12.172 --> 17:13.344
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

17:13.413 --> 17:16.206
- Yay, Patrick!
See, little guy?
- 耶，帕特里克！
看到了吗，小家伙？

17:16.275 --> 17:18.758
Everything is gonna be
just... uh...
一切都会有的
只是……呃……

17:18.827 --> 17:21.034
Fine!
[panting]
美好的！
[气喘吁吁]

17:21.103 --> 17:24.034
- [laughing]
- [笑]

17:24.103 --> 17:26.758
[music slows down]
[音乐放慢]

17:26.827 --> 17:27.896
- Um...
[whistles]
- 嗯...
[口哨声]

17:27.965 --> 17:30.034
Patrick!
- [screeches]
帕特里克！
- [尖叫声]

17:30.103 --> 17:33.448
- Follow that kid!
- Vroom, vroom, vroom!
- 跟着那个孩子！
- 呜呜呜！

17:33.517 --> 17:35.448
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

17:37.793 --> 17:40.206
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

17:40.275 --> 17:42.137
- He's headed
for the Soggy Sock Flume!
- 他已经领先了
对于湿透的袜子水槽！

17:42.206 --> 17:45.758
- The first time you called me
your best friend
- 你第一次打电话给我的时候
你最好的朋友

17:45.827 --> 17:48.689
was on the Glove Flume.
在手套水槽上。

17:48.758 --> 17:50.172
- Aww.
- 哇。

17:50.241 --> 17:51.965
Oh!
Stop this thing!
哦！
停止这件事！

17:52.034 --> 17:53.965
Ah!
啊!

17:54.034 --> 17:56.000
both: [yelling]
两人：[大喊]

17:56.068 --> 17:58.551
- Whoa!
- Whoa! Whoa-ho!
- 哇！
- 哇！哇哦！

17:58.620 --> 17:59.896
both: There he is!
两人：他在那儿！

17:59.965 --> 18:01.379
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:01.448 --> 18:03.862
- Don't worry, kid,
we're right behind you!
- 别担心，孩子，
我们就在你身后！

18:03.931 --> 18:05.482
- [cooing]
- [咕咕声]

18:05.551 --> 18:07.620
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

18:07.689 --> 18:10.137
- [cackles]
- [咯咯笑]

18:10.206 --> 18:12.689
- Stay right there!
We're coming!
- 呆在那里！
我们来了！

18:12.758 --> 18:13.965
- Don't stand up,
- 别站起来，

18:14.034 --> 18:15.620
or they'll put you
in sock jail!
否则他们会把你
在袜子监狱里！

18:15.689 --> 18:17.379
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

18:17.448 --> 18:18.896
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

18:18.965 --> 18:20.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:20.482 --> 18:22.586
- Do you feel a draft,
SpongeBob?
- 你是否感觉到有一股气流，
海绵宝宝？

18:22.655 --> 18:25.517
- I was gonna ask you
the same thing.
-我正想问你
同样的事情。

18:25.586 --> 18:27.241
- [yells]
[bell ringing]
- [大喊]
[铃声响起]

18:27.310 --> 18:29.793
Do you feel a pain
in your butt?
你感到疼痛吗
在你的屁股里？

18:29.862 --> 18:31.034
- No.
- [chomps]
- 不。
- [咀嚼]

18:31.103 --> 18:32.448
- Now I do!
- 现在我知道了！

18:32.517 --> 18:33.620
Ah!
啊!

18:33.689 --> 18:34.827
- [yells]
- [大喊]

18:34.896 --> 18:38.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:38.586 --> 18:40.931
- [yells]
- [大喊]

18:41.000 --> 18:41.896
both: [yelling]
两人：[大喊]

18:41.965 --> 18:43.344
- Whoo-hoo, whoo!
- 呼呼，呼！

18:43.413 --> 18:44.482
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

18:44.551 --> 18:46.482
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

18:46.551 --> 18:47.517
Wah-ha!
哇哈！

18:47.586 --> 18:49.172
[both yell]
[两人大喊]

18:49.241 --> 18:50.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

18:50.931 --> 18:51.965
Yah!
啊！

18:52.034 --> 18:52.965
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

18:53.034 --> 18:55.068
[socks boinging]
[袜子震动]

18:55.137 --> 18:56.827
- Patrick, no more
playing footsy.
-帕特里克，没有了
踢脚。

18:56.896 --> 18:58.482
We gotta save that kid!
我们得救那个孩子！

18:58.551 --> 19:00.586
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

19:00.655 --> 19:02.103
Now we gotcha!
现在我们明白了！

19:02.172 --> 19:04.241
- Huh?
- 啊？

19:04.310 --> 19:06.965
- Come here,
you little whippersnapper!
- 来这里，
你这个小自吹自擂者！

19:07.034 --> 19:09.275
Now I got you!
现在我抓住你了！

19:09.344 --> 19:11.448
both: Hieronymus Glove's robot?
两者：Hieronymus Glove 的机器人？

19:11.517 --> 19:13.551
- Hey, you found the kid!
Thanks.
- 嘿，你找到了那个孩子！
谢谢。

19:13.620 --> 19:15.206
We'll take him off
your hands now.
我们会把他带走
现在你的手。

19:15.275 --> 19:17.310
- Sure, you can have him,
- 当然，你可以拥有他，

19:17.379 --> 19:19.965
right after I take off
his bloomin' head!
起飞后
他那盛开的头！

19:20.034 --> 19:22.103
- [gasps]
No!
- [喘气]
不！

19:22.172 --> 19:26.103
- Hmm...
[grunts]
- 嗯...
[咕哝]

19:26.172 --> 19:28.655
Here you go.
I did it for you.
干得好。
我是为你做的。

19:28.724 --> 19:29.931
- Aww.
- 哇。

19:30.000 --> 19:32.103
But I wanted to do it!
但我想这么做！

19:32.172 --> 19:34.793
That's the whole point,
you pink plonker!
这就是重点，
你这个粉红色的笨蛋！

19:34.862 --> 19:36.689
[grunts]
[咕哝]

19:36.758 --> 19:37.931
- Hot potato!
- 烫手山芋！

19:38.000 --> 19:39.310
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

19:39.379 --> 19:41.103
- [whimpering]
Heads up!
- [呜咽]
注意！

19:41.172 --> 19:42.482
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

19:42.551 --> 19:45.275
- [laughing]
- [笑]

19:45.344 --> 19:47.172
- I should have done this
hours ago.
- 我应该这样做
几个小时前。

19:47.241 --> 19:48.655
That's a good boy.
那是个好孩子。

19:48.724 --> 19:51.620
- I don't know what
a pink plonker is,
- 我不知道什么
一个粉红色的笨蛋是，

19:51.689 --> 19:52.862
but I don't like it!
但我不喜欢它！

19:52.931 --> 19:54.103
[grunts]
[咕哝]

19:54.172 --> 19:55.448
- [yells]
- [大喊]

19:55.517 --> 19:57.689
- [grunting]
[electricity crackles]
- [咕哝]
[电流爆裂声]

19:57.758 --> 19:59.482
Ooh. Hey!
哦。嘿！

19:59.551 --> 20:01.758
I like this body
better than mine.
我喜欢这个身体
比我的好。

20:01.827 --> 20:03.172
It comes with pockets!
它带有口袋！

20:03.241 --> 20:06.482
- I like my new body too!
- 我也喜欢我的新身体！

20:06.551 --> 20:09.068
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

20:09.137 --> 20:12.103
But I still want that head!
但我还是想要那个头！

20:12.172 --> 20:14.517
[roaring]
[咆哮]

20:14.586 --> 20:16.896
- I said I was sorry,
you weirdo!
- 我说过我很抱歉
你这个怪人！

20:16.965 --> 20:19.310
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

20:19.379 --> 20:21.034
[heads popping]
[头爆了]

20:24.034 --> 20:25.793
- [laughs]
- [笑]

20:25.862 --> 20:29.137
- Enough!
- 足够的！

20:29.206 --> 20:32.172
No, no, this won't do at all.
不，不，这根本不行。

20:32.241 --> 20:35.103
Put those heads back
on their bodies posthaste.
把那些头放回去
匆忙地在他们的身体上。

20:35.172 --> 20:36.896
Splendid!
灿烂！

20:36.965 --> 20:38.310
both: Wow!
两人：哇！

20:38.379 --> 20:41.965
Are you the real
Hieronymus Glove?
你是真实的吗
希罗尼姆斯手套？

20:42.034 --> 20:44.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

20:44.068 --> 20:45.241
- No, he's not!
- 不，他不是！

20:45.310 --> 20:47.758
I'm the real Hieronymus Glove.
我是真正的希罗尼姆斯手套。

20:47.827 --> 20:48.965
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

20:49.034 --> 20:50.275
Splendid.
灿烂。

20:50.344 --> 20:52.068
Do wipe that one's memory bank,
请擦除那个人的记忆库，

20:52.137 --> 20:54.137
before he does more damage
to my park.
在他造成更多伤害之前
到我的公园。

20:54.206 --> 20:55.586
Thank you!
谢谢你！

20:55.655 --> 20:57.586
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

20:57.655 --> 21:00.620
- Not him.
The other one.
- 不是他。
另一个。

21:00.689 --> 21:02.310
- Oh!
- 哦！

21:02.379 --> 21:04.724
Beep, bleep, beep, beep,
beep, boop, boop, beep!
嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟，
嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟！

21:04.793 --> 21:10.137
And that's why we wear gloves
on our hands and not our knees.
这就是我们戴手套的原因
在我们的手上，而不是我们的膝盖上。

21:10.206 --> 21:11.655
Ha-ha!
哈哈！

21:11.724 --> 21:13.275
- Splendid!
- 太棒了！

21:13.344 --> 21:16.034
I'm afraid I'm the real
Hieronymus Glove.
恐怕我才是真正的我
希罗尼穆斯手套。

21:16.103 --> 21:18.862
And I'm at your service.
我随时为您服务。

21:18.931 --> 21:21.517
both: We love your gloves!
两人：我们喜欢你的手套！

21:21.586 --> 21:22.896
- Splendid!
- 太棒了！

21:22.965 --> 21:25.758
And since being terrorized
by our robots
自从被恐吓之后
由我们的机器人

21:25.827 --> 21:28.413
has never been
Glove World policy,
从来没有
手套世界政策，

21:28.482 --> 21:33.068
you are all hereby released
from Glove Jail.
你们都被释放了
来自手套监狱。

21:33.137 --> 21:34.862
both: We've been pardoned!
两人：我们被赦免了！

21:34.931 --> 21:36.862
Splendid!
灿烂！

21:36.931 --> 21:38.344
- Splendid.
- 太棒了。

21:38.413 --> 21:43.344
And, for proving yourselves
to be unselfish and kind,
并且，为了证明自己
做到无私和善良，

21:43.413 --> 21:47.241
I'm going to give all of Glove
World to the both of you.
我要把手套全部献上
世界属于你们俩。

21:47.310 --> 21:48.689
both: [gasping sharply]
两人：[急促地喘气]

21:48.758 --> 21:49.724
[drills whirring]
[钻头呼呼作响]

21:49.793 --> 21:51.862
Really?
真的吗？

21:51.931 --> 21:52.862
- Of course not.
- 当然不是。

21:52.931 --> 21:54.103
[laughs]
[笑]

21:54.172 --> 21:56.379
I may be cryogenically frozen,
我可能会被低温冷冻，

21:56.448 --> 21:58.103
but I'm not a loony.
但我不是疯子。

21:58.172 --> 21:59.896
[all laugh]
[全都笑]

21:59.965 --> 22:02.448
♪ Well, that concludes
our show ♪
♪ 好了，就这样结束了
我们的表演♪

22:02.517 --> 22:03.827
♪ And as you can see ♪
♪ 正如你所看到的 ♪

22:03.896 --> 22:06.448
♪ There still is nothing
quite like gloves ♪
♪ 还是什么都没有
很像手套♪

22:06.517 --> 22:09.586
♪ Until we meet again
for a shopping spree ♪
♪ 直到我们再次见面
疯狂购物♪

22:09.655 --> 22:12.172
♪ Where I hope you buy all
kinds of gloves to love! ♪
♪ 我希望你能全部买到
各种令人喜爱的手套！ ♪

22:12.241 --> 22:15.862
♪ With the handy help
of SpongeBob and Patrick ♪
♪ 有了方便的帮助
海绵宝宝和帕特里克 ♪

22:15.931 --> 22:18.448
♪ We defeated
my crazy robot head ♪
♪ 我们打败了
我疯狂的机器人头♪

22:18.517 --> 22:19.793
♪ Now that the twit is gone ♪
♪ 现在傻瓜已经消失了 ♪

22:19.862 --> 22:21.655
- ♪ Glove World can carry on ♪
- ♪ 手套世界可以继续下去 ♪

22:21.724 --> 22:24.034
- ♪ And the toddler
can go to bed ♪
- ♪ 还有那个小孩
可以去睡觉了♪

22:24.103 --> 22:25.241
Good night!
晚安！

22:25.310 --> 22:27.379
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

22:27.448 --> 22:29.206
- Hey!
- Get back here, little guy!
- 嘿！
- 回到这里，小家伙！

22:29.275 --> 22:30.931
- I saved you a ham fist!
- 我给你留了一个火腿拳头！

- 我给你留了一个火腿拳头！